OL,3,GNEWSA'Active' talks over final bid for
OL,4,Atown centre sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sale of a town centre could go to a
OL,7,Ffinal offer soon, despite reports of a
OL,8,Fstalemate in a message from its owner.
OL,10,FStockton Council intends to buy
OL,11,FBillingham town centre outright, having
OL,12,Fpreviously intended to purchase part of
OL,13,Fit from current owners Sheet Anchor
OL,14,FEvolve.
OL,16,FHowever Sheet Anchor Evolve said it was
OL,17,F"unable to reach an acceptable
OL,18,Fposition" with the council and would
OL,19,Fnot sell to them, according to a
OL,20,Fdirector's message seen by the Local
OL,21,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
