OL,3,GNEWSA'Active' talks over final bid for
OL,4,Atown centre sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite this, both the council and
OL,7,FSheet Anchor Evolve said they were
OL,8,Fstill in "active discussions", with a
OL,9,Fformal offer yet to be made.
